\par
This document is an invented test policy and makes no claim about any real organization.\par
Incident review records must be retained for 45 days after closure.\par
The service owner records a decision, rationale, evidence link, and follow-up owner.\par
Operational memory means retaining the reason for a decision so another person can apply or challenge it later.\par
Each review should connect the decision to source evidence and an accountable owner.\par

